     GitHub servers, is requested. The server receives only what a network request
     cannot do without (in particular, your IP address), plus the Software version.
     GitHub handles this information under its own terms.
6.2. Downloading an update — only at your command, from the same servers.
6.3. AI sheet review — only when you start it. The content of the reviewed sheet — text
     labels, sheet and block names, coordinates and extents of objects — is sent to the
     address you selected in the settings. By default this is a local server on your
     computer, and the data does not leave it. If you selected a cloud service, the
     data is transmitted to that service and processed under its terms; the Author does
     not control such processing and is not responsible for it.

Logs and the diagnostic package are created locally and are shared only by you and at
your decision.


